Z||000000||Sevaan||06-12-2001||10:37 PM||||I was watching a Seinfeld rerun tonight. It was the episode where George leaves a tape recorder in his briefcase to see what the people at Susan's charity say about him when he leaves the room. And Elaine tells her new boyfriend about how she doesn't want kids. And Kramer falls in love with Jerry's girlfriend and requests the help of Newman to talk to her romantically.<P>Anyway, the point is that there is an establishing shot of Jerry's apartment and there is a nice yellow Fiero GT parked outside, right in the middle.<P>And now you know.||||reg||6
